# astrion-skill v1
goal: Show a cheatsheet of keyboard shortcuts
trigger:
  - phrase: "shortcuts"
  - phrase: "keyboard shortcuts"
  - phrase: "hotkeys"
do: |
  Open a Spotlight-style overlay listing the most-useful shortcuts:
  Cmd+Space (Spotlight), Cmd+Tab (app switcher), Cmd+W (close window),
  Cmd+, (settings), Cmd+/ (this cheatsheet). Categorize by app/system.
  Tap-anywhere dismisses. Toggle with the same shortcut.
constraints:
  level: L1
  budget_tokens: 150
  reversibility: FREE
